msgid "Bezier Curve Track"
msgstr "Pista de curva de Bézier"

msgid ""
"A bezier curve track is similar to a property track, except it allows you to "
"animate a property's value using a bezier curve."
msgstr ""
"Una pista de curva de Bézier es similar a una pista de propiedad, pero "
"permite animar el valor de una propiedad mediante una curva de Bézier."

msgid ""
"Bezier curve tracks and property tracks cannot be blended "
"in :ref:`AnimationPlayer <class_AnimationPlayer>` and :ref:`AnimationTree "
"<class_AnimationTree>`."
msgstr ""
"Las pistas de curva de Bézier y las pistas de propiedad no se pueden mezclar "
"en :ref:`AnimationPlayer <class_AnimationPlayer>` ni en :ref:`AnimationTree "
"<class_AnimationTree>`."

msgid ""
"To create one, click \"Add Track -> Bezier Curve Track\". As with property "
"tracks, you need to select a node and a property to animate. To open the "
"bezier curve editor, click the curve icon to the right of the animation "
"track."
msgstr ""
"Para crear una, haz clic en «Añadir pista -> Pista de curva de Bézier». Al "
"igual que con las pistas de propiedad, debes seleccionar un nodo y una "
"propiedad para animar. Para abrir el editor de curvas de Bézier, haz clic en "
"el icono de la curva situado a la derecha de la pista de animación."
